## CODE STRUCTURE FACTS (verified by reading)
### combat.ts
- CombatCallbacks: onDamage,onShake,onUnitMoved,onLog,onStateChange,onCombatEnd,isBlockedByProp,animateMove,animateAttack. Add new cb methods here + in Game.startCombat wiring.
- killUnit(u,killer) at ~line305: place to emit death-anim event (add cb.onUnitDied?.(u)).
- dealDamage handles backstab/execute/resists/push. spells: SpellDef fields incl selfMove,buffAp,aoe,push.
- endTurn: poison tick (end of turn); startTurn: fire tile dmg, webbed MP reduction.
- AI: runAI specials buff_allies/invisible/pull/push_charge/aoe_mage; aiApproach uses reachable(u.pos,u.mp,GRID,this.blocked) + bfsPath; aiAttack builds ad-hoc SpellDef.
- moveCells() only for player; spellRangeCells(idx). For intent preview: compute per-enemy reachable + attack range union (new method intentCells(uid)).
- makeUnit(defId,pos,isPlayer) — player defId 'frail_hollow'. Combat ctor starts turn immediately.
- Player spells: PLAYER_SPELLS 6 slots: slash(3AP 1r),heavy(5AP push),soulbolt(3AP 2-6r),emberburst(4AP aoe1),warcry(2AP +2AP once),dash(2AP 1-3 selfMove). To add unlockable spells: extend PLAYER_SPELLS + gate by save.unlockedSpells (new field) in Hud + castSpell check.
### Game.ts
- MoveAnim{unit,path,seg,t,done}, AttackAnim{unit,target,t,done}. loop(): unitOverride Map<uid,screenpos>; attack anim = sine lunge 0.35 toward target, t+=dt*3.2.
- playerWalk + unitWalk maps passed to r.drawEntities. WALK_FRAMES from assets.
- render(): drawHighlights({moveCells,rangeCells,aoeCells,telegraphs,fireTiles,hoverCell,time}); drawEntities({units,props,bonfire,npcs,doors,soulDrop,unitScreenOverride,activeUid,playerWalk,unitWalk,time}); drawFx(1/60). explore mobs drawn as lead mob w/ labels.
- SaveData fields (types.ts) incl openedChests, clearedGroups, bossDefeated, wardenDefeated, droppedSouls, hasAshenCrown. NEW fields needed: unlockedSpells:string[], quests:{grommOre:number; elaraMemories:number; grommDone:boolean; elaraDone:boolean}, secretsFound:string[], sentinelDefeated:boolean — must update defaultSave() in core/save.ts with migration (spread defaults over loaded).
- loadPage filters cleared groups; special-cases d5 boss + p4_0 warden. Zone2: add pages to PAGES + neighborPage handles transitions (check world.ts impl for grid naming p{x}_{y}; zone2 could use s{x}_{y} with own neighbor logic).
- onCombatEnd: victory drops old_bone/iron_shard 50%. Add drop tables + rare boss drops here (warden: bone_helm exists; add uniques).
- interact()/updateInteractHint(): bonfire/npc/chest within manhattan<=1. Illusory wall secret: add prop kind or special check in exploreStep when blocked.
- restAtBonfire clears clearedGroups (respawn). applyStats reads equipment (armor/helmet/ring slots only, one each).
- exploreStep edge → tryPageTransition → neighborPage(page.id,dir). Dungeons use doors: dungeonEntrance/dungeonNext/exitToOverworld on PageDef.
- Player spawns 'frail_hollow' makeUnit; player.sprite URLS.player.
- startCombat wires callbacks incl animateMove/animateAttack; combat.physMult/magMult/weaponFlat set from stats.
### types.ts
- PageDef.tileset: "ash"|"crypt" — need to add "sunken". PropKind list fixed — add "illusory" & "memory" maybe. Unit has poisoned/webbed/invisible/staggered fields.
- HudState.canInteract = hint string. GameMode = menu|explore|combat|dead|victory.

