## Implementation notes
- Death anims: on unit death in combat.ts emit event; renderer: fade+particles (bone shards for skel_*, ash embers others). Track dying units w/ timer in Game.ts; keep drawing corpse fade ~0.8s.
- Attack anims: attackAnims already lunge; add sheet-frame playback for player (knight_attack) + skel_melee/beast when attacking; frame = floor(t*6).
- Intent preview: hoverCell over enemy in combat → compute BFS reachable tiles (mp) + attack range union → renderer.drawDiamond red tint.
- Status visuals: fireTiles already exist (check renderer); add flicker; poison drip: green particles above poisoned units; webbed: white strand arcs.
- New spells: spells.ts add ember_bolt (range 3-8, 3AP), ashen_slam (AoE cross, 4AP), shadow_step (dash 4 tiles, 2AP, ignores blocking). Unlock via Elara level-up menu (levels 5/10/15?) — store unlocked in save.
- Loot: items.ts extend (heavy armor -1MP +HP, quick blade +1AP low dmg, etc.); drop tables per mob tier; Warden/Kardorim rare uniques.
- Quests: save.quests {gromm_ore: state, elara_memories: count}; quest items in chests/mob drops; dialogue additions in Dialogue.tsx.
- Secrets: world.ts pages with illusory wall props (walk into → reveal passage), hidden chests, secret miniboss page.
- Zone 2 "The Sunken Reach": extend world grid pages (e.g. new page set s0_0..s2_2 3x3) accessible via crypt exit after kardorimDefeated flag.
- Weather: renderer particle layer — ash flakes drifting (overworld ash pages), fog banks (crypt/sunken).
- Touch: on-screen virtual joystick (pointer events) bottom-left, tap targets enlarged; detect touch via matchMedia(pointer:coarse).
